  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. Halve potatoes lengthways.\n• Place on the lined oven tray, cut-side down. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Bake until golden and tender, 40-45 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bca9095903fdc2c00dee9a/step-b0ce91bd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When potatoes have 15 mins remaining, grate carrot. Finely chop garlic.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook carrot until softened, 2-3 mins. Stir in garlic, BBQ spice blend (add less if you're sensitive to heat) and tomato paste until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in kidney beans (including liquid) and vegetable stock powder and cook until thickened, 3-4 mins. Stir through butter and the BBQ sauce. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bca9095903fdc2c00dee9a/step-7e72833e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar, olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Just before serving, add tomato and salad leaves and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bca9095903fdc2c00dee9a/step-79125f22.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide potatoes between plates.\n• Top with bean chilli and a dollop of yoghurt. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and chilli flakes (if using).\n• Serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bca9095903fdc2c00dee9a/step-9aa4e4e9.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
